SlowpokeWell_1F_Text_GruntIntro::
    .string "This is ROCKET business.\n"
    .string "Stay away from our operation!$"

SlowpokeWell_1F_Text_GruntDefeat::
    .string "How did you get past me?$"

SlowpokeWell_1F_Text_GruntAfter::
    .string "Our commander is still here!$"

SlowpokeWell_1F_Text_NoRequest::
    .string "Do you even know why you came?\n"
    .string "Go ask that old man KURT.$"

SlowpokeWell_1F_Text_Guards::
    .string "My guards are still fighting.\n"
    .string "Deal with them before me!$"

SlowpokeWell_1F_Text_Intro::
    .string "We lost a base in KANTO,\n"
    .string "not our ambition!\p"
    .string "These sales will fund our\n"
    .string "return. You cannot stop us!$"

SlowpokeWell_1F_Text_Defeat::
    .string "We have to pull out!$"

SlowpokeWell_1F_Text_Rescue::
    .string "The ROCKETS leave the well.\n"
    .string "The SLOWPOKE are safe.\p"
    .string "KURT needs to hear the news.$"

SlowpokeWell_1F_Text_SlowpokeWorried::
    .string "SLOWPOKE watches you quietly.\n"
    .string "It seems uneasy.$"

SlowpokeWell_1F_Text_SlowpokeSafe::
    .string "SLOWPOKE looks calm again.$"

